  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<section>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>⚠️需要 Terralith 和 Vanilla Backport</strong></h2>\n<p>黄石生物群系缺少其最具标志性的特征：间歇泉。</p>\n<p>此数据包增加了在该生物群系中岩浆块上方生成强力硫磺块的概率，从而形成天然间歇泉。硫磺喷口在水下浅水区域生成。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_30cc8eaf-85a0-42aa-b127-ed2435e680b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"610\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div>",
